    "detailed_description": "<h1>Muffed is Better with Gamepads!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/f48ef322d7620bf1c296860ef6f2f612.avif?t=1726708996\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/ab89737202472aaca35ccc223b196f05.avif?t=1726708996\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/39286235090fbc966cc3e8c10200947d.poster.avif?t=1726708996\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/39286235090fbc966cc3e8c10200947d.webm?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/39286235090fbc966cc3e8c10200947d.mp4?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Fight your friends until someone goes home crying with 9 Battle Modes, 15 maps, and customizations for up to 16 players</strong><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/ffa1a000cc235114376ecbdc96781c4c.avif?t=1726708996\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/43e13965dd1e71b822223537a19a5b45.poster.avif?t=1726708996\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/43e13965dd1e71b822223537a19a5b45.webm?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/43e13965dd1e71b822223537a19a5b45.mp4?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Learn to hate Dr. Wolfe in the story comics--no reading required, then hunt him down (with up to 3 friends) across 25 levels and 5 boss battles in the Co-Op campaign</strong><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/63360648ae767638d75a271eb8f087a6.poster.avif?t=1726708996\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/63360648ae767638d75a271eb8f087a6.webm?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/63360648ae767638d75a271eb8f087a6.mp4?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Finished the campaign? Test your mettle in the 4 endless survival levels, definitely co-opable</strong><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/8fc753a92ba07bcf8363317954c9fb97.avif?t=1726708996\" /></div><br><strong>Not vibing with these levels? Make your own and share with the community in the Workshop</strong><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/b83cdbe892ac6a10d5f861e6495f33e6.poster.avif?t=1726708996\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/b83cdbe892ac6a10d5f861e6495f33e6.webm?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong>Awesome Muffs headphones provide slaying power to aid you in your struggles (batteries not included)</strong><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/9fdd3b58122857b7cedc8f0607aafbd7.poster.avif?t=1726708996\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/9fdd3b58122857b7cedc8f0607aafbd7.webm?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/9fdd3b58122857b7cedc8f0607aafbd7.mp4?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Over 50 weapons so you can play your way with quick-swap weapon combos, or just throw stuff, no judgement here</strong><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/f48ef322d7620bf1c296860ef6f2f612.avif?t=1726708996\" /></div><br><strong>The game modes are multiplayer, most controllers are supported, and it's all Drop In/Drop Out, so nobody has to watch, your friends can play too. </strong><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/165aa2fd7935335a93dc95ab6392439b.poster.avif?t=1726708996\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/165aa2fd7935335a93dc95ab6392439b.webm?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/165aa2fd7935335a93dc95ab6392439b.mp4?t=1726708996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Holiday Theming\u2014because, let's be honest, it's just not a holiday party unless it ends in a fight</strong><br><br><strong>Happy Hunting!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661200/extras/af8a7fb9ecc8c752d023d9899da2ac9a.avif?t=1726708996\" /></div><br><strong> - Kelsam</strong>",
